# /etc/fedora-cosmic-atomic/net-box.env — private settings for cosmic-net-box (spec N4, F10).
# Written once by the migration (M10); root-only. Template shipped in the image.
#
# Cisco Secure Client .deb (5.1.15 or later). Cisco publishes it only behind a login, so this
# is the link your work IT provides. cosmic-net-box downloads it again whenever the file there
# is newer, and installs it in the net box with apt. Empty: Cisco is not installed; the work
# VPN then runs through NetworkManager-openconnect (method a), which needs no package.
CISCO_DEB_URL=""
